startPhase1 instead of substituting state.NOOP(); the resulting instance holds an empty (non-nil) command list, which executeCommands accepts because its guard is also a nil test, and handleCommit'\"'s re-offer path does not recognise it because that path requires exactly one command with operation NONE.\\\",\n   \\\"conditions\\\":\\\"Recovery whose replies include one from a replica that holds the instance with no command, when that reply's VBallot is at least the running candidate ballot (epaxos/defs.go:228-235, epaxos/epaxos.go:1239-1246, 1291-1296, 1307-1311 and 1090-1099).\\\",\n   \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"s-prepare-reply-unmarshal\\\",\\\"s-prepare-reply-adopt\\\",\\\"s-subcase-dispatch\\\",\\\"s-decl-prepare-reply\\\",\\\"s-commit-repropose\\\",\\\"s-exec-reply\\\"],\n   \\\"executions\\\":{\\\"81a44ff62122417db3cc5697fc5303f6\\\":[3,4,5,9,10,11],\\\"098ab4425325464192aa558be557f0ce\\\":[3,4]}}],\n \\\"interpretations\\\":[rec]},open('draft/update32.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('written')\nPY\ntimeout 120 /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-16_15-11-32-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission update32.json 2>&1 | tail -3\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
